# Doubling Chant: one ChangeZone | ChangeType$ Creature | SameNameAsEach$ Valid
# Creature.YouCtrl searches the library once and offers, for the Bears, the
# cards sharing its name (ChangeZoneEffect.java, PR 12381). Only the library
# Grizzly Bears shares the Bears' name: it is the one card offered, and it
# enters; Llanowar Elves stays in the library.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 1 G
tapformana human 2 G
tapformana human 3 G
tapformana human 4 G
tapformana human 5 G
tapformana human 6 G
queue paygeneric G
queue paygeneric G
queue paygeneric G
queue paygeneric G
queue paygeneric G
castspell human 8
queue cardchoice 10
resolvestack
